uantitative ecology. All projects have linkages to forest management. <br></div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">The post-doc and some of the PhD students will work closely with the Boreal Avian Modelling Project. Positions will be located either at U of Alberta or U. Laval. </div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">Please distribute to anyone you think might be interested. </div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\">Thanks,</div><div style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,102,102)\"><br></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#336666\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Nicole K.S. Barker</font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,102);font-size:12.8px\">Coordinating Scientist</span><font color=\"#336666\"><br></font></font></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,102);font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Boreal Avian Modelling Project</font></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,102);font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"http://www.borealbirds.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.borealbirds.ca/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494911899000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZAKtQHSO9MXx8EoHOdkTw\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">www.borealbirds.ca</font></a></span></div><br><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,102,102);font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\"><br></font></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div><br></div></div>\r\n"
